# Long-running Tests

Long-running tests are designed for extended execution periods, currently up to 10h in CI/CD.

These tests are excluded from presubmit checks and only run on selected postsubmit builds to prevent pipeline bottlenecks.

## Naming conventions

- Src file: sdv_long_running_name_test.py
- Test class: SdvLongRunningNameTest
- CATBox config: sdv-long-running-name-test.xml
